## What This Document Is NOT

| It is NOT... | It IS... |
|---|---|
| A capability statement (1 page) | A multi-page bid response (7-10+ pages) |
| A one-long-scrolling-page HTML file | A paginated document designed for PDF output |
| Something you build from scratch each time | A template you fill in with solicitation-specific content |
| Something with random/different styling each time | A document that ALWAYS matches the cap statement colors |

