## PDF Conversion Instructions (for Dee)

1. Open the `.html` file in **Google Chrome** (or Safari)
2. Press **Cmd + P** (Print)
3. Change destination to **Save as PDF**
4. Set paper size to **Letter**
5. Set margins to **Default** or **None** (the HTML has its own margins)
6. Check **Background graphics** checkbox
7. Click **Save**

Each section will be on its own page. The cover page will be page 1. TOC will be page 2. Sections follow in order.

